Spec: Development Android Binder Broker

Purpose:
  Expose bounded negotiation and opt-in pending registration without exporting the legacy transport service.

Owns:
  ./build.gradle
  ./README.md
  ./src/main/AndroidManifest.xml

References:
  /docs/adr/0005-android-binder-bootstrap.md
  /android/control-ipc/control-ipc.sdd

Must:
  Use a distinct development package, explicit binding action, no INTERNET permission and no transport dependencies.
  Keep default builds read-only; require explicit `linkgatePendingRegistration=true` for experimental pending registration.
  Keep publishing, grants and business-flow capabilities unsupported in every build.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Build the bounded read-only Binder entry and verify portable negotiation and quota behavior.
  [x] #2 Build opt-in durable pending registration and verify portable SQLite transactions.

Done when:
  JVM checks and development APK construction pass with native identity and cross-UID tests explicitly left unverified.
